		<div id="fsPageBodyWrapper" class="fsPageBodyWrapper">
			<div id="fsPageBody" class="fsStyleAutoclear fsPageBody">

				<main id="fsPageContent" class="fsPageContent">
							<h1 class="fsPageTitle">School Board</h1>




							<div class="fsPageLayout fsLayout fsOneColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_2214" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_2215"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_5202" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_5203"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_5201" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>The Wylie ISD Board of Trustees consists of seven members who act as our district&rsquo;s policy-making body. Board members are elected by the Wylie ISD community to govern and set policy for the district.</p>

<p>Board members are elected at large to four-year terms. The Board of Trustees has set goals for the district and works with the Superintendent and staff to ensure that the community&rsquo;s vision is carried out.</p>

<p>Together, the Wylie ISD Board of Trustees and Superintendent function as a &ldquo;TEAM&nbsp;OF&nbsp;EIGHT&rdquo; while maintaining open communication with district stakeholders.</p>


	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsContainer interior-infographic" id="fsEl_5207" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
