	<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_5206" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<hr class="horizontal-rule-style" />
<p style="text-align: center;">Sign up to be notified of upcoming Wylie ISD Board of Trustees meetings. Wylie ISD will send out an email prior to each Board meeting. These emails will list upcoming meeting dates and include links to agendas, previous board recaps and minutes.</p>

<div style="text-align: center;"><a class="button-1" href="https://forms.gle/h6mQGwtFz4nbAk147 " rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Link to register for notifications of upcoming Wylie ISD board meetings. Opens in a new window.">Wylie ISD Board Updates</a></div>


	</div>


	</div>
	



