	<section class="fsElement fsContent footer-tagline" id="fsEl_3666" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_3666">Non-Discrimination Policy:</h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p>The Wylie Independent School District does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, sex, disability, or age in its programs and activities and provides equal access to the Boy Scouts and other designated youth groups. The following persons have been designated to handle inquiries regarding the non-discrimination policies: Executive Director of Student Services and Assistant Superintendent of Human Resources | 951 S. Ballard Avenue, Wylie, TX 75098 | 972.429.3009.</p>


	</div>


